flowchart TB
  accTitle: TravelOps critical transaction flow
  accDescr: Shared inventory locks, atomic payment and Outbox, calls outside order transactions, verified confirmation, and coordinated refund and venue redemption.
  online[Online checkout] --> reserve
  pos[Store-authorized POS] --> reserve
  subgraph tx1[Transaction 1 · reserve shared inventory]
    reserve[Lock actor / product / inventory balance<br/>Validate quantity and idempotency key] --> snapshot[Order + item snapshot + inventory reservation]
  end
  snapshot --> payment[Signed Mock payment confirmation<br/>POS local Mock capture is in its outer transaction]
  subgraph tx2[Payment transaction]
    payment --> inbox[Lock order + payment<br/>Unique event + body hash + amount validation]
    inbox --> outbox[Consume reservation + mark paid<br/>Persist issuance Outbox + notification rows]
  end
  outbox --> relay[Scheduler scans durable due work]
  relay --> queue[Redis Queue → Worker]
  queue --> claim[Short transaction<br/>Lock order + Outbox; persist lease + request key]
  claim --> adapter[OUTSIDE order transaction<br/>Query Mock ledger before issuing or retrying]
  adapter --> result{Result available?}
  result -->|yes| confirm[New transaction<br/>Validate lease / order state; record result]
  result -->|pending or timeout| recover[Durable retry / query recovery<br/>or signed Mock callback with unique Inbox event]
  recover --> confirm
  confirm --> ticket[Ticket + per-venue entitlements]
  ticket --> guard[Redemption transaction<br/>Lock order, ticket and venue entitlement]
  refund[Operations approves full refund<br/>under the same order lock] --> guard
  guard --> check{Approved / unresolved refund?}
  check -->|yes| blocked[Pause redemption]
  check -->|no| redeem[Consume one authorized venue entitlement]
  refund --> refundjob[Durable refund relay → Worker<br/>Mock refund call outside order lock]
  refundjob --> settled[Confirmed settlement transaction<br/>Revoke tickets + release sold stock<br/>Schedule supplier cancellation]
  note[Synthetic data · local Mock integrations<br/>No claim of real payments or production throughput]
